  "description": "The Lost Mary Nera30K Fullview Prefilled Pod Kit combines long-lasting performance with a stunning 3D curved display, offering an interactive, visually dynamic vaping experience like no other. Designed to offer convenience, exceptional Lost Mary flavour and the freedom to customise your flavour loadout, this rechargeable prefilled pod system can provide up to 30,000 puffs per kit while maintaining the ease of disposables. Powered by an 800mAh built-in battery, the Nera30K features dual Turbo and Normal output modes, letting you customise your vape for either a richer, more intense draw or a smoother, extended-use experience. The device’s intelligent vaping status display keeps track of battery life and e-liquid levels, ensuring a seamless and intuitive experience. The kit includes two 2ml 20mg prefilled pod cartridges and two 10ml auto-refilling e-liquid containers, delivering a continuous supply of Lost Mary’s renowned MaryLiq nic salt blends. The mesh coil technology inside each pod ensures consistent, full-bodied flavour with every puff, making it an ideal option for mouth-to-lung (MTL) vapers. The Lost Mary Nera30K Fullview comes in 21 mixed-flavour editions and 10 single-flavour classics, each inspired by Lost Mary’s signature MaryLiq e-liquid blends. Nera30k Fullview Prefilled Pod Kit Flavours - Mixed Flavour Editions Blue Edition: Blueberry Sour Raspberry, Blueberry Raspberry Gami Purple Edition: Summer Grape, Strawberry Raspberry Ice Berry Edition: Berry Mix, Blueberry Cherry Blackberry Blueberry Edition + Stargazer: Blueberry Sour Raspberry, Blueberry Raspberry Ice Cherry Edition: Cherry Ice, Sparkling Cherry Red Edition: Strawberry Watermelon, Raspberry Watermelon Yellow Edition + Stargazer: Pineapple Ice, Banana Ice Green Edition + Stargazer: Lemon Lime, Mint Drinks Edition + Stargazer: Cola, Pink Lemonade Watermelon Edition + Stargazer: Watermelon Ice, Strawberry Watermelon Nera30k Fullview Prefilled Pod Kit Flavours - Single Flavour Editions Strawberry Ice Cherry Ice Triple Mango Pineapple Ice Blueberry Sour Raspberry Lemon Lime How to Use: 1. Remove all packaging and protective film. 2. Separate the refill container and prefilled pod, then push the container into the base until it clicks. 3. Remove the silicone plug and attach the prefilled pod to the device. 4. Power on and vape. The Lost Mary Fullview Nera30K is the ideal prefilled ‘Big Puff’ pod system for vapers who want an easy-to-use, great value vaping experience enhanced by Lost Mary’s world-famous flavours – with the freedom to customise your kit with any combination of Nera15K pods. Please Note: USB-C charging cable is not included and must be purchased separately. Shop Lost Mary Nera Refill Pods",
